{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "1a03f8250709ca5232675afeecf0502e234fb9e3f8a4e5c5b65ff56d8fa99b0a", "ja": "踊ればHAPPY！ジャングル☆パーティー♪", "zh": "跳舞就HAPPY！丛林☆派对♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3ce2e7ba7c162a5de18ecc1d0c5c8cdcad88c9cc648641fdb82f9845244ac4cc", "ja": "環は『劇場の魂』とも友達になりたいと、『\nジャングル☆パーティー』を踊る。その想い\nに動かされ、一緒に踊った『劇場の魂』は幸\nせな気持ちになり、みんなを開放して……。\nそして、プロデューサーは夢から覚めた。", "zh": "环表示也想跟『剧场之魂』成为朋友，\n于是跳起了『丛林☆派对』。『剧场之魂』\n被她的心意打动，一同跳起舞来，\n从中感受到幸福，便解放了众人……\n接着，制作人从梦境中醒了过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8101d904e917c573b9a29551b417e0fdea737546614f250b95524067a53078fe", "ja": "（世界を滅ぼそうとする劇場の魂に、環が立ち向か\nおうとしている……。そんなの無茶だ、環！）", "zh": "（环打算挺身对抗企图毁灭世界的剧场之魂……\n这实在太勉强了，环！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "93be373732120b42ad39e78ec4e888959faaf6127fd0a49d528dbfd72b9c8801", "ja": "たまきが相手だぞっ、ユーレイ！", "zh": "你这幽灵，由环来当你的对手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cca3a7019a7cf4263458094eff2b2bcdc4ce8535bfea53396df2a5d747756cfc", "ja": "よせ、環！\nそいつは真でも敵わなかった相手だ！　早く逃げろ！", "zh": "环，快住手！\n那家伙是连真都对付不了的对手！你快逃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "81433fbcf9b834e9fa2f03a4246ec9f8406e927648d348c547a5fc83bce88560", "ja": "大丈夫だぞ、おやぶん！　まみも、おやぶんも、\nみんなも！　たまきが助けるっ！", "zh": "没问题的，老大！无论是真美、老大，\n还有大家都一样！环会救你们的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "6b6013a3420da6dd9887122f359ad14e7cfb0bd608317a56c53eb3ab596ecf94", "ja": "ムダなこと。\n環ちゃんでも、私にはかなわない。", "zh": "没用的。\n就算是小环也赢不了我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "1b1258ba3c64b75f50cf804854624d70919e3dafd9a9972164e1eda97625248f", "ja": "たまき、ぜったいに負けないぞ……！\nだって、たまきはレッドだから！", "zh": "环是绝对不会输的……！\n因为环是红色战士！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "946fe2ee0ce9f4e08ae1950ce657fb2ebbce9b18a668ec8b3385a8382991d07e", "ja": "……なにを言っているの？", "zh": "……你在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "0017efb84773d56f777455db21602a752c211673e0b5e9a8ad1c9a20b0be0bfe", "ja": "レッドは、だれとでも一番仲良しなんだ！\nだからたまき、みんなと友達になりたい！", "zh": "红色战士跟任何人都处得很好！\n所以环想跟大家做朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "aeb3d1c99c271ffc2da355a971f1d8a6ea21df483f46e0d4f99368a81aeed894", "ja": "もっとみんなに、笑ってもらいたい！\nお前とも、友達になりたいぞ！", "zh": "环希望大家都可以更常欢笑！\n环也想跟你做朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "8b29359d674e74321026e01eca5ffb9bc1bec16a24126972f5c3fd77ef0cbac0", "ja": "環ちゃん、アナタに構っているヒマは……。", "zh": "小环，我没有时间理你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "ee750271ff3b4a92bd4691062b1f41d79a9c9dbf519ec9c636a83d7749233695", "ja": "ウンババー！", "zh": "嗯吧吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cbac882b5701702baad3b769683bc1884370d99cac527f072aa133b720ea3999", "ja": "はっ、これは……！？\nどこからか曲が流れてくる！", "zh": "什么，这是……！？\n音乐是从哪传过来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "4b792b62b68e00fa84aec3c879d810eae3057fbbbf87feda03209d22fad303fe", "ja": "『ジャングル☆パーティー』は、みんなと\n友達になれる歌なんだぞ！　たまきのライブを見て！", "zh": "『丛林☆派对』是一首能够让大家当好朋友的歌喔！\n你看环的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "ecd444c852047863291e42462ae4e3eb1872ade57059598e59597b863f841dac", "ja": "ウンババウッホッホ！", "zh": "嗯吧吧呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "ca49cf9e50496184670939b98b0bacffcef3e20d6c311aea96c725a59e1d3d02", "ja": "そんな歌で、私を止めようなんて……！", "zh": "竟然想用那种歌来阻止我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1015_se", "source_sha256": "ed961f63c004029dac6b177079842e57431c2091e0c5dde937d7df77c60fb85c", "ja": "ズドドドドドド！", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆隆隆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "73856d5625aeafae37239e6302dd8336d5fdcdbb757c36c19fab988bf4875fdc", "ja": "うわっ、この地響きはなんだ！？", "zh": "呜哇，地面为什么会震动起来！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1017_gorira", "source_sha256": "af93f32ab590a38d063b503d248f83a79c453338e7b4f554c4d7bbb93ec2dc43", "ja": "ウホホー♪", "zh": "呜吼吼──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1018_hebi", "source_sha256": "3e94ef88bcaf56a8ca6921f30004e84cc423b6ba295e73735de73d2426231327", "ja": "シャー♪", "zh": "嘶──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1019_saru", "source_sha256": "e095a38ff1f63bf60493108b08fe44bf865d9daab0cfd5cc1a7fc0cf3c6e1782", "ja": "ウッキッキーッ♪", "zh": "吱吱──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "201bbdcbf4048c0fbf8882f199d9effc39546a6e3354d9d80dec67f81dd92b0c", "ja": "ゴリ子、みんな！　来てくれたんだね！", "zh": "猩猩子还有大家！你们都来了耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "96c7aac4c2671637e5691717bbb1e1f9eab27af71c257d47ebf3142d0d84bb06", "ja": "『ジャングル☆パーティー』に引き寄せられて、\nまた動物たちが集まってきたのか！", "zh": "原来动物们又受到『丛林☆派对』吸引\n而聚集过来了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d3ec1a7fadb649d3b19806c06051bf814739865865c46fc2b1325dfa629c5592", "ja": "イェーイ、アタシもだよ！　こんな楽しそうなダンス、\n参加しなくっちゃ損だもんな！", "zh": "耶～我也过来了喔！这么有趣的舞蹈，\n没参加到可是我的损失！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "63b1f7534281c7d1fff2ace24dbf9bde6426b2d0ee841616ec58e29fc67f29a8", "ja": "ボクも踊るよ！\nもっと、みんなと一緒に楽しみたいから！", "zh": "在下也要跳舞！\n因为在下想跟大家同乐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "0a2be4f42f108377e8814d3cf127ff569e42dc510dc5a7a752ed4cfd7cc0fc24", "ja": "あゆむ！　まこと！　くふふっ♪\nそれじゃあ、みんな、行くぞ～！", "zh": "步！真！呵呵♪\n那么大家，要开始啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b178cca0f2afa2671707af4fe43e9296d3ba0beb1747732c477a0f5f035e4d6c", "ja": "ん？　俺へのプレッシャーも軽くなって……。\nよし、今だ！　俺も踊るぞ、たまき！", "zh": "嗯？我身上的压迫感也变轻了……\n好，就是现在！我也来跳舞啰，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_1026", "source_sha256": "ecd444c852047863291e42462ae4e3eb1872ade57059598e59597b863f841dac", "ja": "ウンババウッホッホ！", "zh": "嗯吧吧呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2000_040tam", "source_sha256": "ecd444c852047863291e42462ae4e3eb1872ade57059598e59597b863f841dac", "ja": "ウンババウッホッホ！", "zh": "嗯吧吧呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2001_006mak", "source_sha256": "ecd444c852047863291e42462ae4e3eb1872ade57059598e59597b863f841dac", "ja": "ウンババウッホッホ！", "zh": "嗯吧吧呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ecd444c852047863291e42462ae4e3eb1872ade57059598e59597b863f841dac", "ja": "ウンババウッホッホ！", "zh": "嗯吧吧呜吼吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2003_012mam", "source_sha256": "ffabf5745464a2f3423b33a0c3456a7f0ba63b56235af475068a99bb0691822d", "ja": "何だ、何が起こっている！？\nそれに、何なの、この気持ちは！", "zh": "什么？发生了什么事？\n还有这个感觉是怎么一回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2004_p", "source_sha256": "19896a6655d39ce2232b07d35a857cbce98b6a0a4928cc588b019800481be4a3", "ja": "これがアイドルの力だ！\n765プロの一員のお前なら、わかるだろう！", "zh": "这就是偶像的力量！\n你既然身为765艺能的一员，应该懂吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2005_012mam", "source_sha256": "73a8d36e1a8ee48e54977f36b0a29e3b3b83c4fd1b204f4922312853c8d82d62", "ja": "くっ！　環ちゃん達がウンババしているのを\n見ていると、胸がざわめく……！", "zh": "呜！看着小环他们在嗯吧吧，\n我的胸口便不停躁动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2006_040tam", "source_sha256": "dbfd1e50b2fe67a6967a97406afa99a505de91b18d79313deb7340e9e26a8380", "ja": "ガマンしなくていいんだぞ！\n一緒に踊ろー！", "zh": "你不需要忍耐喔！\n跟环我们一起跳吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2007_012mam", "source_sha256": "0259d191871ab66a52eabe33caa6aec5112fdd91212c2efe3b708c5bb956e1fb", "ja": "……ウンババー！", "zh": "……嗯吧吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2008_p", "source_sha256": "e136226a38884c5b56df0d3186e8dcfaefc02cca5ea3e4bd5d029fa504058544", "ja": "（環の想いがついに劇場の魂を動かし、俺たちは一緒に\n『ジャングル☆パーティー』を、最後まで踊った……）", "zh": "（环的心意终于打动了剧场之魂，\n我们一起将『丛林☆派对』跳到最后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2009_040tam", "source_sha256": "ace523ec0885509482b738a38663f0780b3641257311470207419cb6889f8f79", "ja": "くふふっ、すーっごく楽しかったぞ～！", "zh": "呵呵，真的好开心喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2010_012mam", "source_sha256": "62ad343b9249e7503cafaf87ac45fed70acb2ebc297c1c09c920382718a40a5e", "ja": "……ありがとう、環ちゃん。みんな。\n今、私は幸せな気持ちでいっぱい。", "zh": "……谢谢你，小环，还有大家。\n现在我真的感到十分幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2011_p", "source_sha256": "af27df3b4dfacdba313e7c8934fc02478a913b56f333b260d13247397b0f7bca", "ja": "もっと、みんなに歌と踊りで、幸せを届けたい。\nだから、地方公演をするんだ。", "zh": "我希望大家可以用唱歌跳舞的方式，传递更多幸福，\n所以才要举办地方公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2012_p", "source_sha256": "0cd7e4e3208565f0fc79e7ccc5dffe0280a8adcad9168de25ca45fe65635a47b", "ja": "けど、何があっても、\n劇場がこの子達のホームだよ。", "zh": "不过，无论未来发生什么事，\n剧场都是这些孩子的家喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2013_040tam", "source_sha256": "614b8f6cf76027dd1816c558a027e59a9f1bd500ce5e681a74907337da3615e2", "ja": "うんっ！　たまきもあゆむもまことも、おやぶんも！\n劇場が、だーいすきだぞ！", "zh": "嗯！环跟步还有真跟老大都一样！\n最──喜欢剧场了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2014_012mam", "source_sha256": "7314716978034d7dc6e3f2e379cb854bc01d99a50daee298dc83b97b2021027b", "ja": "……私は、夢のカケラでできている。\n夢を、世界中に届けてくるわ。", "zh": "……我是由梦想碎片组成的。\n我要去把梦想传递到全世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2015_012mam", "source_sha256": "875924854e5cfc0564645e0768a710e52e0be0afc08afc17f6129a1962acab3b", "ja": "アナタ達を元の世界に帰そう。\n真美ちゃんも、元に戻るわ。それじゃあ……。", "zh": "就把你们送回原本的世界吧。\n小真美也会恢复原状，再见了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2016_040tam", "source_sha256": "153237ad9ad853c05d2622b9eae19d62dce7a7af7a4a44c6c7be4828e1bfc352", "ja": "また、みんなで遊ぼうね！\nたまき達、友達だぞっ！", "zh": "下次再跟大家一起玩吧！\n环我们都是你的朋友喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2017_012mam", "source_sha256": "e4fdd2f24eda5bc8b61656e73ee938773cfe964f0b49c4f0e385447f2fd41f8f", "ja": "……うん。バイバイ。", "zh": "……嗯，拜拜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2018_se", "source_sha256": "28c1961fdfbae7179de5a488381165b99080c49b9df4c5928b99d6acaec28f95", "ja": "パアアアアアア！", "zh": "唰啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2019_p", "source_sha256": "768968ffdf4768dc93fbbec85b77eaf044fdbc52a5d16dbfe5feb3e3069ef243", "ja": "（……ここは？）", "zh": "（……这里是哪里？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2020_p", "source_sha256": "4c1bfb36b08d93d9589a9fca82fd335d76c4a3d40f91b46dbc8fb2831bfabba0", "ja": "（……控え室か。\nどうやら、俺は眠ってしまっていたようだ）", "zh": "（……原来是准备室。\n看来我是不小心睡着了呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2021_012mam", "source_sha256": "ee750271ff3b4a92bd4691062b1f41d79a9c9dbf519ec9c636a83d7749233695", "ja": "ウンババー！", "zh": "嗯吧吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2022_040tam", "source_sha256": "9f2cf262f22d7a6c2bc55b6fd366e0b02893c84262534595d53f140510cd798d", "ja": "ウッホッホー！", "zh": "呜吼吼──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2023_p", "source_sha256": "17020f19c9644007126e95e2b4b7a1d204c2f60e5064a8d8eb77da5723fe290d", "ja": "ん？　真美、環……。\n二人とも、ちゃんと戻ってたんだな。", "zh": "嗯？真美、环……\n你们两个都平安回来了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2024_040tam", "source_sha256": "031063dbdca8797ca14cf26c6677d836e992124b58b2ed40ccf0f476d56e85c7", "ja": "あっ、おやぶん起きたんだ！", "zh": "啊，老大醒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2025_012mam", "source_sha256": "9726a48a50177f2c648bfe62b716bfd4b810fea99d43f38786a31bed34851bf7", "ja": "真美たち、地方公演、メッチャやる気モリモリだよ！\n早く遠くの兄ちゃん姉ちゃんに会いたいね、たまきち！", "zh": "真美我们对地方公演充满了干劲喔！\n真想早点见到远方的大哥哥大姊姊呢，对吧阿环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2026_040tam", "source_sha256": "da89cb51d8d4e0f747fb722f9d93802a8af426e6cd8178fe4fe717eaebe5fff4", "ja": "うんっ！　『ジャングル☆パーティー』で、\nみんなと友達になりたいぞ！", "zh": "嗯！环想用『丛林☆派对』\n跟大家做朋友喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2027_p", "source_sha256": "8067e4ec201fb3678c354ede88bad9092f028fc7c577119c7585446a9418f9e7", "ja": "ああ。環たちなら、\nきっとみんなと友達になれるさ。", "zh": "嗯。环你们一定很快\n就能跟大家成为朋友的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2028_012mam", "source_sha256": "71e8538a7edcef2ac584ce353bc82196d0b1da6d2441cfafa759ccfe307429e1", "ja": "ん？　ところで兄ちゃん、真美たちが戻ってたって、\nどゆこと？　兄ちゃんが勝手に寝てただけっしょ？", "zh": "嗯？话说回来，大哥哥，你刚刚说真美我们回来了，\n是什么意思？明明只是大哥哥自己睡着了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2029_p", "source_sha256": "78b129314866ded0e92e84075a520dc342c429b56de6241592559725c09aee74", "ja": "そうか……。いや、なんでもないんだ。\nいきなり寝ちゃってごめんな。", "zh": "这样啊……不，什么事都没有。\n抱歉，我突然睡着了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2030_p", "source_sha256": "26b840bf724a9ece45451e1a1d0ba5f53fbf276eb6b257c1329bedf312678c44", "ja": "（その後、いちおう倉庫も確認してみたものの……）", "zh": "（在那之后，姑且还是确认了一下仓库，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2031_p", "source_sha256": "e30fb60d5b0f41652b1c2df3d7d82c3fb99ad9425ec99dabbe7477989e90a233", "ja": "やっぱり、いつも通りの倉庫か。\nあれは夢だったのかもしれないな。でも……。", "zh": "果然是平常的仓库啊。\n说不定那只是我在做梦，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_06_2032_p", "source_sha256": "a079ff7d7d9040fbc006f9d626333e1a0946876cc8175dcec3f23b7837059dfe", "ja": "劇場、いつもありがとう。\nこれからも、みんなを見守っててくれよ！", "zh": "剧场，一直以来谢谢你。\n今后也要请你继续守护大家喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
